{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06579","headline":"题辛道士房 · 储光羲","name":"题辛道士房","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"全神不言命，所尚道家流。\n迨此远南楚，遂令思北游。\n先生秀衡岳，玉立居玄丘。\n门带江山静，房随瑶草幽。\n逍遥三花发，罔象五云浮。\n自有太清纪，曾垂华发忧。\n大年方橐龠，小智即蜉蝣。\n七日赤龙至，莫令余独留。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"储光羲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06579.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06579","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}